abstract: "Reproducible grouped evaluation of the incremental predictive value of HER full-cell voltage for CO Faradaic efficiency in a pinned OCx24 dataset. The tested models do not show a stable practically useful gain. The local protocol freeze was not public preregistration; replay is not a new blind evaluation."
